sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor O as Desi
  participant N as Next.js server
  participant DB as Supabase Postgres (RLS)
  participant C as Cache

  O->>N: GET /admin/testimonials (signed in with LinkedIn)
  N->>DB: select * (RLS: is_admin() required for non-approved rows)
  DB-->>N: pending + approved + rejected
  O->>N: Approve testimonial #id
  N->>N: Re-check session and is_admin on the server
  N->>DB: update status = approved, reviewed_at = now()
  DB-->>N: ok
  N->>C: revalidatePath('/') + revalidatePath('/testimonials')
  N-->>O: Updated list
